        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Night Latch Function Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a wide Escutcheon Plate Night Latch Function Lever (Outside entrance by lever when latch bolt is retracted by Key)  is suitable for all Wide and Medium  Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. Old Item# PDQ-629LPEKXH\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-rim-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300r\"><b>6200 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/wide-escutcheon-plate-passage-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-ew-14-phl\"><b>Passage Function Lever for 6200 Series Panic Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/wide-escutcheon-plate-classroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-ew-08-phl\"><b>Classroom Function Lever for 6200 Series Panic Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 6-EW-09-PHL Keyed Night Latch Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Night Latch Function (ANSI F03) - Outside entrance by lever when latch bolt is retracted by Key.  (Lever only opens door when the key is turned). Key removable only when locked (Night Latch).</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Height: 8-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Wide Escutcheon Plate Night Latch Lever for Panic Device, PDQ 6-EW-09-PHL",
                "description": "PDQ 6-EW-09-PHL Wide Escutcheon Plate Storeroom Function Lever (Outside entrance by lever when latch bolt is retracted by Key)  is suitable for all Wide or Medium Stile Doors. Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8 inch door prep. For use with PDQ 6200 Series Panic Devices.",
